#: app/bot/routers/download/handler.py:99
msgid "download:message:connect_to_vpn"
msgstr ""
"<b>{platform}:</b>\n"
"\n"
"First, you need to download the app on your device. After installation, "
"you can use the `🔌 Connect` button <i>(the key will be automatically "
"connected in the app)</i> or copy your key and paste it manually.\n"
"\n"
"<b>📋 Detailed connection instructions:</b>\n"
"\n"
"<b>For v2BOX:</b>\n"
"1️⃣ Download and install V2Box from App Store (iOS) or Google Play (Android)\n"
"2️⃣ Open the V2Box application\n"
"3️⃣ Go to the \"Configs\" tab\n"
"4️⃣ Tap the \"+\" icon in the top right corner\n"
"5️⃣ Select \"Import v2ray uri from clipboard\"\n"
"6️⃣ Copy the subscription link from the bot (click on the subscription link in your profile)\n"
"7️⃣ Paste the link into V2Box and confirm the import\n"
"8️⃣ Select the added server from the list\n"
"9️⃣ Return to the main screen and tap \"Tap to Connect\" to connect\n"
"\n"
"<b>For v2BOX (Android) / V2Box (iOS) / v2rayN (Windows):</b>\n"
"1️⃣ Download and install the application\n"
"2️⃣ Click the \"🔌 Connect\" button below - the key will be automatically added to the app\n"
"3️⃣ Or copy the subscription link from your profile and paste it manually into the app\n"
"4️⃣ Select a server from the list and connect\n"
"\n"
"<i>💡 Tip: If automatic connection doesn't work, use the «Subscription link» button below or copy the subscription link from your profile and paste it manually into the app.</i>"

